      'Bubble Surge rewards deliberate aiming and a steady pace. Match early when you can, use wall bounces to reach blocked clusters and watch the red arc as a warning. [Play Bubble Surge online](/play/bubbles) for a quick arcade puzzle, or try [Pipe Connect](/play/pipe) for a route-planning challenge without a rising field.',
